  {
   "id": "w15",
   "type": "markdown",
   "source": "## Sharing your work\n\n**Export** writes LaTeX (with figures), a self-contained HTML page, Markdown, a Maxima batch file or a wxMaxima document. wxMaxima files (`.wxm`, `.wxmx`) and Maxima batch files open directly."
